        "other": [],
        "vote": "8-1",
        "remedy": "Reverse the Seventh Circuit and remand. Reinstate the punitive award unless an actually preserved independent ground requires vacatur; the rejected lack-of-contractual-power theory cannot sustain vacatur or denial of confirmation. No independent ground is invented or decided. The paid compensatory award is untouched."
